    {
      "id": "u_e8638aa4ca899de8278e71ca_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The dashboard is currently considered beta. This means that it might face some changes in behavior until it is stabilized.",
      "sourceHash": "e8638aa4ca899de8278e71cae788d3beac06f704a67eec084947bdee232bb581",
      "context": "Dashboard",
      "contextHash": "67b696468610b879ed7f224dbf6b0861f27e39d20454cb9d7af1ec52d3e5eeaa",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_241d66aba81c714dce65f7e6_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The dashboard is a collection introduced in Trilium v0.104.0. It is similar to the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Grid View__TRILIUM_PH_1__ collection, but with some key differences:",
      "sourceHash": "241d66aba81c714dce65f7e63a9295d7018c553f2a8ece6b99d7825fec77d5e9",
      "context": "Dashboard",
      "contextHash": "67b696468610b879ed7f224dbf6b0861f27e39d20454cb9d7af1ec52d3e5eeaa",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_559008e812cc29e39c8cc689_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The grid layout is not fixed, allowing for tiles of varying widths and heights. The grid has 12 columns and an unlimited number of rows.",
      "sourceHash": "559008e812cc29e39c8cc6895ae3d8088a089985e3b6076098269939a246f13c",
      "context": "Dashboard",
      "contextHash": "67b696468610b879ed7f224dbf6b0861f27e39d20454cb9d7af1ec52d3e5eeaa",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_efa9bb8ab377473f6461f562_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Each widget represents a child note of the collection and can be reordered or resized.",
      "sourceHash": "efa9bb8ab377473f6461f562554be18bfc88137de849b9973be7d0ba48f0355a",
      "context": "Dashboard",
      "contextHash": "67b696468610b879ed7f224dbf6b0861f27e39d20454cb9d7af1ec52d3e5eeaa",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b924f8beb1fd84f5f2d57cea_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The grid will distribute the columns evenly to fill the entire screen.",
      "sourceHash": "b924f8beb1fd84f5f2d57cea33034b7ecc6e12715fc001274da8e9ae800e7bd3",
      "context": "Dashboard",
      "contextHash": "67b696468610b879ed7f224dbf6b0861f27e39d20454cb9d7af1ec52d3e5eeaa",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4cee5000b9a5e90d4f0bcded_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If the available space is too low (e.g. in a split or in mobile), the columns are collapsed so that all widgets are displayed one under the other.",
      "sourceHash": "4cee5000b9a5e90d4f0bcded11a91dd756224d08928d0ac45a1b7b08624ddd92",
      "context": "Dashboard",
      "contextHash": "67b696468610b879ed7f224dbf6b0861f27e39d20454cb9d7af1ec52d3e5eeaa",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2d8b39b03130805ada45a62e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "While the columns are collapsed, the widgets cannot be reordered or resized.",
      "sourceHash": "2d8b39b03130805ada45a62efe8c1344d41e7d07ca8d5f7984533fd8c9ac7ee7",
      "context": "Dashboard",
      "contextHash": "67b696468610b879ed7f224dbf6b0861f27e39d20454cb9d7af1ec52d3e5eeaa",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f093ac6126d127359ff874ab_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Unlike the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Grid View__TRILIUM_PH_1__, the widgets are not clickable which allows them to be interactive.",
      "sourceHash": "f093ac6126d127359ff874abf44eb801e5a802c901dd87293e4532998bcbc111",
      "context": "Dashboard",
      "contextHash": "67b696468610b879ed7f224dbf6b0861f27e39d20454cb9d7af1ec52d3e5eeaa",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4e157401e419b62bdb532558_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Types of widgets__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "4e157401e419b62bdb532558d4c4802ca6f9026a529d2c944bc5ae4c35863441",
      "context": "Dashboard > Types of widgets",
      "contextHash": "fbc50275156adf4acb16a3ae852626557e769c01eb28739669a1fe54116c23be",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f5c8fefd32c79fa1cdf868e7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The dashboard uses the same rendering mechanism as the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Grid View__TRILIUM_PH_1__ or the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Note List__TRILIUM_PH_3__, which means every note can be rendered, such as:",
      "sourceHash": "f5c8fefd32c79fa1cdf868e75ed50bb9da3ffefef42d96366d70d959d3d2c15d",
      "context": "Dashboard > Types of widgets",
      "contextHash": "fbc50275156adf4acb16a3ae852626557e769c01eb28739669a1fe54116c23be",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fc61bb2cfd5f1e0dd02b5dd9_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Static content, via __TRILIUM_PH_0__Text__TRILIUM_PH_1__ or __TRILIUM_PH_2__Code__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "fc61bb2cfd5f1e0dd02b5dd92bd3dff3941fbec363c64c80562e731d249f583d",
      "context": "Dashboard > Types of widgets",
      "contextHash": "fbc50275156adf4acb16a3ae852626557e769c01eb28739669a1fe54116c23be",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0e2953d95e3cc03752deb995_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Images via __TRILIUM_PH_0__File__TRILIUM_PH_1__, __TRILIUM_PH_2__Mermaid Diagrams__TRILIUM_PH_3__, __TRILIUM_PH_4__Mind Map__TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "0e2953d95e3cc03752deb99540cb321efcbd4aa0076e3beda590136e72ab6440",
      "context": "Dashboard > Types of widgets",
      "contextHash": "fbc50275156adf4acb16a3ae852626557e769c01eb28739669a1fe54116c23be",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_deac72423eb0f24d9bf72362_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Interactive widgets via __TRILIUM_PH_0__Render Note__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "deac72423eb0f24d9bf723628b009922a860479c3dbb3ef1c8c9818c970fb4ae",
      "context": "Dashboard > Types of widgets",
      "contextHash": "fbc50275156adf4acb16a3ae852626557e769c01eb28739669a1fe54116c23be",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fa4db30a741442a76da0dd51_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Web pages can be displayed via __TRILIUM_PH_0__Web View__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and refreshed via the context menu.",
      "sourceHash": "fa4db30a741442a76da0dd51ff83ec189638dc988aa2411f04b3e488d3d9b4ef",
      "context": "Dashboard > Types of widgets",
      "contextHash": "fbc50275156adf4acb16a3ae852626557e769c01eb28739669a1fe54116c23be",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a95caf8f0fb1ea4f650df200_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Collections__TRILIUM_PH_1__ render interactively inside the dashboard",
      "sourceHash": "a95caf8f0fb1ea4f650df200a1ccbb920c5c2f171dd6cd52937588a55b669f74",
      "context": "Dashboard > Types of widgets",
      "contextHash": "fbc50275156adf4acb16a3ae852626557e769c01eb28739669a1fe54116c23be",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1c172ded2b18b107a96e0bff_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Interactive widgets through the use of __TRILIUM_PH_0__Render Note__TRILIUM_PH_1__ is the highlighted use case of the dashboard. Using the __TRILIUM_PH_2__AI__TRILIUM_PH_3__ chat, these widgets can be easily created as the AI is instructed in how to write them.",
      "sourceHash": "1c172ded2b18b107a96e0bff4e26c582b51118c6d4427d708b2f5e18f658de0f",
      "context": "Dashboard > Types of widgets",
      "contextHash": "fbc50275156adf4acb16a3ae852626557e769c01eb28739669a1fe54116c23be",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fd53891573519ebd2d4345b2_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Adding new widgets__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "fd53891573519ebd2d4345b2825d33f08d5a62c8f912fdbb303ccac3e3a48f4e",
      "context": "Dashboard > Adding new widgets",
      "contextHash": "139e37fb13167c9145672bab51aa955a2acb26fe7cf07046369a557fa4bc22b4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8e3d121aacd8ee1412bde7bd_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "There are two ways to add widgets to a dashboard:",
      "sourceHash": "8e3d121aacd8ee1412bde7bde016d7c2f9422a8d9de8e1eb61493a0702570039",
      "context": "Dashboard > Adding new widgets",
      "contextHash": "139e37fb13167c9145672bab51aa955a2acb26fe7cf07046369a557fa4bc22b4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2c5c42fd74aa159d51bd286f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Create a child note of any type, the dashboard will automatically pick it up and add it onto the grid.",
      "sourceHash": "2c5c42fd74aa159d51bd286fe3a26880c9cd4b5b63a8dd083f793cb6d954d636",
      "context": "Dashboard > Adding new widgets",
      "contextHash": "139e37fb13167c9145672bab51aa955a2acb26fe7cf07046369a557fa4bc22b4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5163d01fc7c21f1446008c2b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "From the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__, drag an existing note onto the dashboard and it will be placed there. This will __TRILIUM_PH_2__clone__TRILIUM_PH_3__ the note into the collection.",
      "sourceHash": "5163d01fc7c21f1446008c2bf34f91f8c76236aa50e1639e70b9aeb54d670cc6",
      "context": "Dashboard > Adding new widgets",
      "contextHash": "139e37fb13167c9145672bab51aa955a2acb26fe7cf07046369a557fa4bc22b4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_16d20e141cb8d9925519a1c3_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Read-only dashboards__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "16d20e141cb8d9925519a1c3bee448aa744abbfa2a798dc0e1c6a5942ba56a18",
